/E (For social media posts in facebooks, logo placement should be on the top, with a 70% opacity to reduce eye attention to the logo but also maintaining ownership.  Avoid placing the logo directly in the center of promotional graphics unless necessary for branding campaigns or announcements. The logo should never compete with the main headline or call-to-action. Content hierarchy must always prioritize the message first before branding. Keep logo sizing proportional across all content to maintain consistency throughout the brand ecosystem.)
