/E (Logo Usage Guidelines Maintain consistent spacing around the logo at all times. Never stretch, skew, rotate, or distort the logo. Always use high contrast between the logo and the background. Preferred usage is on the mint background \(#b6e8e6\) or white. The coral accent color \(#f05d62\) should remain the primary highlight color. Avoid placing the logo over highly detailed backgrounds. For social media, maintain enough padding to keep the logo visible even in profile circles.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
